<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/018df56ca472> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Sacked by AI, tech worker found humans could do nothing" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "484" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/02a8abcb6a0f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Diallo explains that once the order for termination is put in, the system “takes over”." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "494" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/08a131470748> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"Who the hell is sending those emails!?\" he bellowed as HAL 9000 looked on without emotion." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "497" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/12ee8c848159> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "This employee was fired by a machine and there's nothing his manager could do about it" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "483" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/15ebe3f51c9c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[487] Ibrahim Diallo was a contractor who joined up with a new contract for a company at just the wrong time." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "487" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/24950b9440e0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Software engineer fired, shut out of office for three weeks by machine" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "497" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2624d9c67cde> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A robot didn't take Ibrahim's job, but it did fire him" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "489" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2c820570175d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The man who was fired by a machine" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "479" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2e977e23494a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Aki Anastasiou says they've also introduced Instagram TV." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "485" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/33197753f074> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[497] And so it was that Ibrahim Diallo, in California, USA, found himself fired from his job, had his network access and his entry card killed, and was unable to get himself reinstated despite his own manager, and even his manager's boss, assuring him that he was still employed." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "497" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3ad00c478c3e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "California man 'sacked by a machine' as bosses stand by helplessly" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "492" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/43a8baf39c29> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[486] Ibrahim Diallo, a Californian software developer, was fired from his job by a machine, because his previous manager hadn’t renewed his contract on the new computer system that lead to various automated systems get into action..." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "486" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4bf4a45e701e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Technobyte: A man who got fired by a machine" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "490" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/53ed667f718c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[487] Eventually, the system sent an angry-sounding and official-looking email that put the director who praised Diallo's shining work and the security guard he was good friends with in the awkward position of escorting him off the premises." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "487" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/61640aa0d2ac> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A Machine Fired An Employee, And No One Could Do Anything About It" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "487" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6e84bddaaff4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Software developer gets fired by a machine" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "486" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/727301191ea9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The termination process for contractors in the company was automated, so the days-long, snowballing process began." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "487" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/772b71f4fb5f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[486] Ibrahim Diallo, a Californian software developer, was fired from his job by a machine, because his previous manager hadn’t renewed his contract on the new computer system that lead to various automated systems get into action and in the end, him being escorted from the office building by two security guards." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "486" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7e1d65f9243f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Man Who Was Fired By a Machine" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "495" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7f4a356e7cb1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[483] To be more specific, an AI concept called \"fuzzy logic\" can interpret situations that aren't only black and white, applying evidence and conclusions in varying degrees to avoid the kind of stark decision-making that led to Diallo's dismissal." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "483" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8cc305ad9e26> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Ibrahim Diallo: The man who got fired by a machine" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "496" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/934830d4e686> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "She couldn't understand why my JIRA was disabled but the system wouldn't allow her to enable my account" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "480" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a1acb0a9dd7c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "She had received an automated email from the work system to say his contract had been terminated." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "482" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a31db89bd679> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Just before he was hired on a three-year contract, the company was acquired by a larger organisation." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "482" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a5eae9550dc0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Fired by an algorithm, and no one can figure out why" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "498" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ac5685a139c2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In scenarios, where one has lost his or her job and livelihood, it requires sensitivity and understanding to handle the situation, which is only possible through human contact and not through an AI chatbot." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "486" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b755ecdc732b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The order to disable my Windows account is also sent. There is also one for my Jira account." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "492" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bff0621a179a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The next day, I took Uber to work, I didn't want to deal with the parking again." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "492" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c01458eedd68> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "I went to my desk and worked for a few hours on hardware. When I was done, I logged into my Windows machine to mark my Jira ticket as completed, that's when I noticed that I had been logged out of Jira." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "480" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c28e3f1f2738> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "This Man Was Fired By a Machine. The Humans Were Powerless to Do Anything. Here's Why the Machine Should Be Admired" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "481" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cb5ec949ebb6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Man 'fired' by machine shows downside of over-automation" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "488" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cba17f145f20> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Technobyte: A man who got fired by a machine" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "485" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d6e74db07a93> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "To be more specific, an AI concept called \"fuzzy logic\" can interpret situations that aren't only black and white, applying evidence and conclusions in varying degrees to avoid the kind of stark decision-making that led to Diallo's dismissal." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "483" .

