<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4fbcef1c123c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[498] Ibrahim Diallo was eight months into a three year contract with a big company when its systems abruptly decided that he was fired: first it told his recruiter that he'd been let go, then it stopped accepting his pass for the parking and the turnstyles, then his logins stopped working." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "498" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/64ca216bd854> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Ibrahim Diallo had been working at a Los Angeles company for just eight months of his three-year contract when his key card stopped working.",
        "Ibrahim Diallo had been working at a Los Angeles company for just eight months of his three-year contract." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "482" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/85d38258d5e8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[482] Ibrahim Diallo had been working at a Los Angeles company for just eight months of his three-year contract when his key card stopped working. [492] Ibrahim Diallo recounted the bizarre sequence of events that started with an early-morning voicemail and ended in him being escorted from the building by two security guards." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "492" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9f36461d5472> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[479] Ibrahim Diallo found himself jobless for three weeks with no idea why" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "479" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1f3d04e1dbe2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Thanks to a friendly security guard, he was buzzed through and went about his day." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "494" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2500030d8f3d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Diallo, a Guinea-born programmer, had been working for a company in Los Angeles." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "496" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/38b5fa8c4fd8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "I fear, though, that's precisely what a lot of, say, Google engineers don't want." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "481" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/507946b095e5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Instagram is ready to compete head-to-head with YouTube." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "485" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/522cce71a1df> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Even though Facebook has finally admitted that this alleged objectivity is bilge piled upon bunkum." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "481" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/538e8c5c095d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The company had been sold, and a hiring manager who was a full-time employee had been knocked down to contractor status and sent to work from home as a budget measure." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "487" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/57b868ad2112> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Then he got a call from his recruiter asking if he was okay, as she received an email saying that Diallo been terminated from his role." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "494" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5ab5abd49ff2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "She picked up the phone and ordered the support team to restore everything." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "492" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5fa564ecbdae> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "She gave me the green light to come to work the next day." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "492" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7453b68cc2cd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Diallo’s previous manager had been laid off and was working out his notice period from home." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "494" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8c834bfca38e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "As soon as I got to my floor, I went to see my manager to let her know. She promised to order me a new one right away." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "492" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b43696a5760b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "There was nothing the director could do about it." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "494" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c71fdc62cb28> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "His story should serve as a cautionary tale about the human-machine relationship, thinks AI expert Dave Coplin." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "479" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c833d4d5688c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "He cordially informed me that he was to escort me out of the building." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "492" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fc3623c287ca> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The director was furious." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "492" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ff7688d51d12> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "They became distant, except for his manager who was “exceptionally supportive”." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "494" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4523b3063513> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Ibrahim Diallo was a contractor who joined up with a new contract for a company at just the wrong time." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "487" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/74549f16a14a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google’s DeepMind unit has been involved in some of the company’s coolest AI breakthroughs in recent years, from outsmarting human Go players to developing more realistic speech synthesis." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "485" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7249bdac8ee5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Ibrahim Diallo, a Californian software developer, was fired from his job by a machine, because his previous manager hadn’t renewed his contract on the new computer system that lead to various automated systems get into action and in the end, him being escorted from the office building by two security guards." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "486" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d4c4ff0878c4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "'The Machine Fired Me' -- a blog post by Ibrahim Diallo speaks of exactly what it is titled." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "483" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d6b23a92c283> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Image copyright Ibrahim Diallo Image caption Ibrahim Diallo found himself jobless for three weeks with no idea why" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "479" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/011ed7b04f86> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "AI expert Dave Coplin told the BBC." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "488" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6e731ca7f9e5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The director of talent at the innovation hub MaRSDD moderated the AI and ethics panel at the HR Tech Summit in Toronto last week." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "488" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e225abf10da4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Eventually, the system sent an angry-sounding and official-looking email that put the director who praised Diallo's shining work and the security guard he was good friends with in the awkward position of escorting him off the premises." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "487" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e58ab5e6d4b6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Darren Gardner, an employment law expert with Sydney firm Bartier Perry, says he's not aware of an identical situation in Australia." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "489" .

